  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DcemWeskeZ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yHlVxSj.png\" alt=\"Discord橫幅\" width=\"140\" height=\"34\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>關於</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Visuality 是一款適用於 Fabric 加載器的 Minecraft 模組。這是一個簡單的客戶端視覺模組，將為您的 Minecraft 世界添加大量新粒子效果，例如水晶閃光、生物攻擊粒子、史萊姆自定義黏液粒子以及環境粒子。隨著模組更新，粒子集合將不斷擴展！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>配置</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">您可以通過編輯 Minecraft 目錄中 config 文件夾內的 visuality.json 來配置模組，或直接通過 ModMenu 整合功能進行設置。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>展示</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/b36gkYh.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZNvWWow.gif\" width=\"400\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NKeDOcG.gif\" width=\"400\" height=\"225\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/896630240170889246/904458353206509618/circles_on_water_2.gif\" width=\"400\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>還有更多</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fvisuality\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></strong></a></span></p>",
